Note count the words and letters in a sentence end note.
Say text Type a sentence. end text
Ask the user for sentence.
Note the text literal on the next line holds a single space end note.
Set pieces to split sentence by text   end text.
Set words to the length of pieces.
Set letters to the length of sentence.
Say text Your sentence has end text, words, text words and end text, letters, text letters, counting spaces. end text
If words is greater than 0, then
  Say text The first word is end text, the first item of pieces.
  Say text The last word is end text, the last item of pieces.
end if.
Say text In capitals it reads, end text, uppercase of sentence.
